contentText:
Karol G is in the midst of her Viajando Por El Mundo Tropitour that kicked off July 24 at Soldier Field in Chicago and will run until 2027 — along the way, she’s surprising fans left and right.&nbsp;

First, just five days into the Live Nation-produced trek that’s in support of her 2025 Tropicoqueta project, the Colombian act announced she was dropping a whole new album called No Me Arrepiento de Sentir Tanto.&nbsp;

“I’ve been locked in for months making new music. For months, I’ve been preparing a segment that will form part of this tour. I want to announce that on August 7, my new album will come out,” she said to fans at Toronto’s Rogers Stadium in July.&nbsp;

